      "statement": "The root Containerfile uses a pinned UBI9 base and five stages (tools-base, sre-tools, claude-builder, tmux-builder, final); only final ships and copies outputs from the builder stages. The root Makefile builds separate AMD64/ARM64 variants with Podman and assembles a multi-architecture manifest.",
